  {
    "hotel_id": "3143234",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/grandiose-hotel-spa/hotel/hanoi-vn.html",
    "name": "Grandiose Hotel & Spa",
    "detail": "My partner and I had a great time at this hotel. We spent the first couple of nights in the centre of Hanoi which can be exhausting and crazy after a while and then moved here to relax. Its location is not ideal if you plan to explore Hanoi since you'll have to take a taxi to the centre every time (which is not expensive or difficult at all, to be honest, though.) But we mostly spent time around the hotel (there's Lotte tower nearby with a huge clean supermarket for souvenir shopping and a rooftop bar), so the location was not an issue for us. (Also, if you ever stay here, do try Pizza 4P's that's just across the street -- it's a very famous/popular pizza restaurant.) The staff were great and very helpful, and the breakfast was good. The room was very clean and spacious, and I really liked the classy ambience of the hotel. I'd highly recommend the hotel especially to those who wants to find some relaxation and peace in Hanoi.",
